# config/

System configuration for logging and behavior.

## Files

log_levels.py       - Event enable/disable per log level (minimal/normal/verbose)
messages_formats.py - Message format functions for each event type
constants.py        - Hardware-wired constants (not user-editable)

## Logging System

Event-based logging where each print/log is an "event".
- Define message in messages_formats.py
- Enable/disable in log_levels.py per level
- Separate knobs for console and file output